<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐθο-κόλλητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set with precious
			stones</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Callix.
					2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτήρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Char.</u>
					23.3
				</span></i>
			, Parmenioap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.782a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρατῆρες</span> Theopomp.
				Hist.<i><span class="en">
				283
			</span></i> (a); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιάλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agatharch.
					102
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτραχήλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				372
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλυβος λ.
			στόμιον</span> a bit of steel <i>set with stones</i> (to make
			it sharper), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1261
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λ.</span>
			<i>inlaid work, mosaic</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				35
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
